{"seq":2,"slug":"biodiversity-farming","title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业生物多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/biodiversity-farming","wordCount":2307,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-可持续农业-农业生物多样性\">研究生 可持续农业 — 农业生物多样性</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>农业生物多样性（Agrobiodiversity）是指与食物和农业生产直接相关的所有生物多样性组分，涵盖栽培作物和家养动物的品种多样性、农田生态系统中的物种多样性，以及支撑农业生产的景观和生态过程多样性。全球作物遗传多样性的急剧丧失令人警醒——FAO估计，20世纪以来全球约75%的作物遗传多样性已经消失，目前人类食物供给的75%仅依赖12种植物和5种动物。保护和利用农业生物多样性是确保食物系统长期韧性和适应气候变化的根本保障。</p>\n<p>多层次框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>遗传多样性（Genetic Diversity）</strong>：作物品种和畜禽品种内部及品种间的遗传变异</li>\n<li><strong>物种多样性（Species Diversity）</strong>：农田生态系统中栽培物种、伴生物种和野生物种的丰富度</li>\n<li><strong>生态系统多样性（Ecosystem Diversity）</strong>：农业景观中不同栖息地类型和生态功能单元的多样性</li>\n<li><strong>功能多样性（Functional Diversity）</strong>：生物群落中不同功能特征（如授粉者、分解者、固氮者）的多样性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"遗传多样性的侵蚀与保护\">遗传多样性的侵蚀与保护</h3><p>**遗传侵蚀（Genetic Erosion）**是指作物或家畜遗传资源多样性的丧失。驱动因素包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>作用机制</th>\n<th>典型案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品种替代</td>\n<td>高产品种替换地方品种</td>\n<td>矮秆水稻品种全面替代传统高秆品种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栖息地丧失</td>\n<td>野生近缘种生境被破坏</td>\n<td>城镇化侵占野生大豆分布区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产系统简化</td>\n<td>轮作制度瓦解、单一化种植</td>\n<td>华北平原冬小麦-夏玉米双季连作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场偏好统一化</td>\n<td>外观和加工性状的商业标准化</td>\n<td>苹果品种从数千种缩减到少数商品种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策因素</td>\n<td>品种审定制度可能限制地方品种推广</td>\n<td>非审定品种不得商业销售</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>原生境保护（In-situ Conservation）</strong>：在自然栖息地中保护野生近缘种，在农户田中保护传统地方品种。中国实施的&quot;农业野生植物原生境保护区&quot;制度覆盖了野生稻（<em>Oryza rufipogon</em>）、野生大豆（<em>Glycine soja</em>）和多种野生果树的自然分布区。</p>\n<p><strong>迁地保存（Ex-situ Conservation）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>种质库（Gene Bank）</strong>：全球最大的种质库包括挪威斯瓦尔巴全球种子库（&quot;末日种子库&quot;，储存约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>110</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">110</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">110</span></span></span></span></span> 万份样品）、CGIAR各国际研究中心的种质库，以及中国国家作物种质资源库（新库设计容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 万份）</li>\n<li><strong>保存条件</strong>：种子在干燥（含水量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7%</span></span></span></span></span>）和低温（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-18°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">18°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 长期保存或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>196</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-196°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">196°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 超低温保存）条件下可保存数十到数百年</li>\n<li><strong>田间种质圃</strong>：适用于无性繁殖作物（如薯类、果树）和顽拗性种子作物</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"农田物种多样性与农业生产力\">农田物种多样性与农业生产力</h3><p>农田物种多样性通过多种途径影响农业生产力和稳定性：</p>\n<p><strong>生态位互补效应（Niche Complementarity）</strong>：不同物种利用不同的资源空间，混合种植系统的总资源利用效率高于单一种植。间作（Intercropping）是实践生态位互补的典型方式。玉米-大豆间作系统中，豆科固氮补充了禾本科的氮需求，两者根系在不同土层中分布的差异性提高了水分和养分的整体利用效率。</p>\n<p>土地当量比（LER）是评估间作系统优势的核心指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LER = \\frac{Y_{a,inter}}{Y_{a,sole}} + \\frac{Y_{b,inter}}{Y_{b,sole}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{a,inter}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{b,inter}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别为间作中作物a和b的产量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{a,sole}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{b,sole}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为各自单作的产量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LER &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示间作的总生产力高于单作。文献综合分析表明，合理设计的间作系统LER平均值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span>，即间作比单作增产 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>保险效应（Insurance Effect）</strong>：物种多样性为生产系统提供了&quot;生态保险&quot;——当某一物种因病害或气候异常受损时，其他物种可以维持系统的总体生产力。这一效应对于应对气候变化带来的不确定性尤为重要。</p>\n<p><strong>稀释效应（Dilution Effect）</strong>：多样化种植可降低专化性病原菌和害虫的传播效率。水稻品种多样性种植（品种混栽）在中国云南的大规模实验证明，感病品种与抗病品种间行混栽可将稻瘟病发病率降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>94</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">94\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">94%</span></span></span></span></span>，完全替代化学杀菌剂的使用（Zhu et al., 2000, <em>Nature</em>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"传粉者多样性危机\">传粉者多样性危机</h3><p>全球传粉者多样性正在经历前所未有的下降，被称为&quot;传粉者危机&quot;（Pollinator Crisis）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全球蜜蜂管理蜂群数量在过去60年间下降了约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>（部分地区更甚）</li>\n<li>野生蜜蜂物种多样性和丰度持续下降，欧洲约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>37</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">37\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37%</span></span></span></span></span> 的蜜蜂物种种群呈下降趋势</li>\n<li>蝴蝶、食蚜蝇等其他传粉者同样面临栖息地丧失和农药暴露的双重威胁</li>\n</ul>\n<p>驱动因素的相对重要性排序（IPBES评估报告）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>栖息地丧失和碎片化（土地利用变化）</li>\n<li>农药暴露（特别是新烟碱类杀虫剂）</li>\n<li>病原体和寄生虫（如蜜蜂狄斯瓦螨 <em>Varroa destructor</em>）</li>\n<li>入侵物种</li>\n<li>气候变化</li>\n</ol>\n<p>新烟碱类杀虫剂（Neonicotinoids）因其对蜜蜂的亚致死效应引发了全球性争论。亚致死剂量暴露不直接杀死蜜蜂，但损害其导航能力、学习记忆和免疫功能。欧盟于2018年在户外全面禁用三种新烟碱类杀虫剂（噻虫嗪、吡虫啉和噻虫胺）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"农业生物多样性与气候适应\">农业生物多样性与气候适应</h3><p>气候变化对农业生产的威胁使遗传资源的战略价值愈加凸显：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>抗旱种质</strong>：野生近缘种和传统品种中蕴含的耐旱基因是育种的宝贵资源</li>\n<li><strong>耐热性状</strong>：随着极端高温事件频率增加，耐高温种质的需求日益迫切</li>\n<li><strong>抗新兴病害</strong>：气候变化导致病虫害分布范围北移，需要新的抗性基因来源</li>\n<li><strong>多样化种植系统</strong>：混合种植和农林复合系统比单一种植系统对气候波动具有更强的缓冲能力</li>\n</ul>\n<p>《粮食和农业植物遗传资源国际条约》（ITPGRFA）建立了多边获取和利益分享系统（MLS），涵盖64种主要粮食作物和饲料作物的遗传资源，促进了育种者对全球种质资源的便利获取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>分析中国某一特定地区（如云南或广西）作物遗传多样性面临的主要威胁，提出原生境保护和迁地保存的综合策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个田间实验，验证品种混栽对水稻稻瘟病发病率的影响。说明实验设计、处理设置和数据分析方法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论土地当量比（LER）作为间作系统评价指标的优势和局限性。还有哪些指标可以更全面地评估间作的生态和经济效益？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析新烟碱类杀虫剂对传粉者的亚致死效应，评估欧盟全面禁用政策的科学依据和潜在经济影响。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>气候变化背景下，作物野生近缘种的保护策略需要如何调整？讨论&quot;气候智能型&quot;遗传资源保护的概念。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>FAO报告</strong>：<em>The State of the World&#39;s Biodiversity for Food and Agriculture</em>（2019）——全球农业生物多样性的最全面评估</li>\n<li><strong>经典实验</strong>：Zhu et al. (2000) &quot;Genetic Diversity and Disease Control in Rice&quot; <em>Nature</em>——品种多样性控制稻瘟病的标志性论文</li>\n<li><strong>传粉者评估</strong>：IPBES (2016) <em>Assessment Report on Pollinators, Pollination and Food Production</em></li>\n<li><strong>种质保存</strong>：访问Genesys种质资源信息门户（<a href=\"http://www.genesys-pgr.org）了解全球种质库资源\">www.genesys-pgr.org）了解全球种质库资源</a></li>\n<li><strong>中国资源</strong>：了解中国作物种质资源信息系统和国家农业种质资源库的建设进展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>农业生物多样性是食物系统韧性、生态系统服务供给和气候变化适应能力的根本保障。从基因到物种到生态系统的多层次多样性共同支撑着农业的可持续发展。遗传侵蚀的加速、传粉者的全球性衰退和农业景观简化的趋势正在削弱这一保障基础。理解遗传多样性保护的原生境和迁地策略、掌握多样化种植系统的生态学原理和效益评估方法、关注传粉者保护的科学和政策动态，是可持续农业研究者的核心知识。在气候变化背景下，农业生物多样性的战略价值将进一步凸显。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业生物多样性","id":"研究生-可持续农业-农业生物多样性"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"遗传多样性的侵蚀与保护","id":"遗传多样性的侵蚀与保护"},{"level":3,"text":"农田物种多样性与农业生产力","id":"农田物种多样性与农业生产力"},{"level":3,"text":"传粉者多样性危机","id":"传粉者多样性危机"},{"level":3,"text":"农业生物多样性与气候适应","id":"农业生物多样性与气候适应"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农业生态系统服务","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/ecosystem-services-agriculture"},"next":{"title":"研究生 可持续农业 — 农林复合系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/sustainable-agriculture/agroecology/agroforestry"}}